{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n韓國A級品質蟹!仲送海鮮豆腐湯\n</p>\n<h2>北角炮台山$388醬油蟹任食放題</h2>\n<p>北角炮台山人氣韓菜店「Antidote」新推出全日供應90分鐘$388醬油蟹任食放題，平時單點一隻生醃醬油蟹已經要 $328，今次食兩隻已經回本！嚴選韓國西海直送嘅新鮮 A級蟹，以秘製醬油醃得入味，蟹肉晶瑩剔透、鮮甜滑溜，帶淡淡醬油鹹香。放題套餐仲包無限追加小菜、白飯，仲會配埋海鮮嫩豆腐湯；每位加$80，仲可以任食醬油蝦和醬油三文魚，CP值超高！</p>\n<p>Antidote<br/>\n地址：北角炮台山福蔭道1號海峰園南峰閣地下4A號舖 電話：<a>6802 0069</a><br/>\n星期一至日 11:00 – 23:00<br/>\n官方IG：@antidote_hk</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480884428932923_17035497566afa9c0ccbb1b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480884428932923_17035497566afa9c0ccbb1b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480884654891987_18639566246afa9c0f16a2c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480884654891987_18639566246afa9c0f16a2c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480884920163560_1506046366afa9c11ae497.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480884920163560_1506046366afa9c11ae497.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfyZOk-k4SR/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:13:17.128687+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":478,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:00:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:08:23.982135+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:06:50.858621+00:00","content_hash":"56fe0b435ce1645c7d98e5528d84c06264fda677e334fde924ebd05810ff11f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}